  "id": "quetiapine",
  "term": "quetiapine",
  "definition": "Quetiapine is an antipsychotic drug in the dibenzothiazepine group. It works by blocking serotonin activity and, to a lesser extent, dopamine receptors in brain pathways linked to psychotic symptoms, which can reduce experiences such as hallucinations and delusions.",
